    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Giving directions",
     "texto": [
      "**어떻게** = how. **지하철역에 어떻게 가요?** = How do I get to the subway station?",
      "**똑바로 가세요** = go straight ahead.",
      "A direction takes **으로** (towards): **오른쪽으로** 가세요 (go right), **왼쪽으로** 가세요 (go left).",
      "**사거리에서** = at the crossroads. **길을 건너세요** = cross the street."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Near or far",
     "texto": [
      "**멀어요** = it is far. **가까워요** = it is near.",
      "**걸어서** = on foot. **걸려요** = it takes. **쯤** attached to an amount means «about»: 걸어서 오 분**쯤** 걸려요 = on foot it takes about five minutes.",
      "If someone thanks you, you can answer **아니에요** («it's nothing»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
